1. Download the `data.enc` file using `wget`.
2. See the content using `cat`.
3. Convert the encoded data into normal data by  using `cyberchef` or `rot 13 decoder` or `https://www.dcode.fr/caesar-cipher` by shifting 3characters forward.
4. Another method is using `echo` command with `tr 'a-z' 'd-za-c'`.
5. The flag will be displayed.

